WEBVTT

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.340
Answer this question.

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:38.000
There is a soba stall on the West Udogawa 
Station platform called Okutama Soba.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.100
What is its most famous offering?

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.320
Oden soba.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:46.330
Correct.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.050
Good morning, Second 
Lieutenant White Robin

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:54.860
and Sergeant Major White Egret.

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:56.630
Good morning, Commander.

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:01.120
They've finally appeared in Udogawa.

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:02.660
Zvezda...

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:08.550
Yes, we, the warriors of justice, 
White Light, consider them our archenemy.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:09.710
Archenemy...

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.820
The secret society Zvezda,

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.820
a mysterious organization led 
by a little girl named Venera

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:18.730
who seeks to conquer the world.

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:21.720
What's this?

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:27.800
Every image is jammed so we 
cannot identify their members.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:30.900
This is the kind of frightening 
technology they possess.

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.250
The West Okubo Tea Party.

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:46.660
<b>A Mysterious Giant in Mitaka Forest?!</b>

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.490
The Mitaka Forest Riot.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:41.550
They've left a distinctive mark in 
the dark area of modern history.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:46.660
<b>Large Amounts of Ude Sweet 
Buns Appear at the Diet Building</b>

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:44.630
Zvezda was hidden behind 
a veil of mystery,

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:46.660
but they've finally made their move.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.370
You are to keep an eye on their actions,

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:52.860
and locate their base of operations.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:53.960
Yes, sir!

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:56.630
Take flight, little birds.

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:00.100
Claw your way to victory!

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.650
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:17.360
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.990
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:21.660
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.410
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:22.740
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:23.030
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:23.700
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:35.970
<b>Martial Law in West Udogawa!</b>

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.140
Good morning, Asuta-kun.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.200
Good morning, Komadori-san.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.320
Did you make it home last night?

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.320
Were you okay last night?

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.440
I was pretty worried.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.000
It must have been 
pretty rough afterwards.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.500
Nah... I, uh, managed...

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.980
What about you?

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.680
I was perfectly fine.

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.560
But I heard that there was a

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:10.490
heavily armed criminal organization 
putting up resistance near the park

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.410
and a lot of damage was done.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.060
Heavily armed...

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.800
Did anyone die?

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:19.710
Nope. Miraculously, no one was injured.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:23.820
But you could have been hurt, 
so you need to be careful, Asuta-kun.

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:25.530
Komadori-san...

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.860
Why are you so concerned about me?

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:30.790
Could it be that...

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.890
Please, there's no reason.

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:36.730
I help people who are in trouble!

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:38.130
I beat up bad guys on sight!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:39.320
It's very normal.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.210
Huh?

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.730
Oh, we need to get going 
or we'll be late.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:44.140
Oh, r-right.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.310
What? School's over already?

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.820
Man, I'm starving...

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:06.950
All I've had since yesterday 
is water and an Udo sweet bun.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:10.750
Where am I going to sleep tonight?

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.300
She looks familiar...

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:29.080
<i>Crap!</i>

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.930
<i>Crap! Crap! Crap! Crap! Crap!</i>

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:43.440
<i>Crap! Crap! Crap! Crap! Crap!</i>

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:01.180
Hey.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.550
Jimon Asatte (day after tomorrow), right?

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.800
No, you're off by a day.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.410
I'm Jimon Asuta (tomorrow).

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.260
Jimon Asuta?

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.720
So it's you.

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:17.270
I'm here to give you your orders.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.990
Direct from Venera the Great!

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:21.900
Venera?

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:28.780
Are you talking about that little kid?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.950
That's right, Jimon Asuta.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:33.420
I am one of the leaders of Zvezda,

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:36.280
the one that burns even 
crying children, Lady Plamya!

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:41.600
Now that you know my secret identity, 
I can't let you leave alive.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.750
You just gave it away voluntarily.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.300
And what kind of orders 
are we talking about?

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:47.840
Education.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:54.090
You'll be in my custody until you're 
living and breathing the Zvezda doctrine.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.840
Meaning that...

00:06:57.260 --> 00:07:00.940
This territory and your school

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.590
will be conquered by 
Zvezda soon enough.

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.230
Until that happens,

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:10.340
I'm responsible for training you hard

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:13.450
to become a loyal soldier 
of Venera the Great!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.130
If you run, I'll torch you!

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.620
If you betray us, I'll torch you!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.590
If you get yourself 
killed, I'll torch you!

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:21.610
H-Hell no!

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:23.210
You can count me out!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:24.340
Or rather...

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:27.050
Help! Someone help!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:29.920
Are you hungry?

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:31.750
Y-Yeah...

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.900
Since I've kinda run away from home...

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:36.520
Then come with me.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:37.770
I can feed you.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:38.710
Huh?

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.770
Not "Huh?"!

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:43.570
Do you want to eat or do you want 
to die right here and now?!

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:45.690
I'll eat! I'll eat!

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:53.720
This is the main base of the 
international secret society Zvezda.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.160
You say that, but...

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:01.160
Secret Society 
<b>Zvezda 
</b>Headquarters

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.090
I'm home.

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.790
P-Pardon the intrusion...

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:14.530
What's this?

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:15.790
Udo?

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:26.430
<i>Aren't these the things 
that formed that monster?</i>

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:28.980
Wait, hold on!

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:34.560
Welcome home, Boss Lady.

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:37.290
Natasha, if you're gonna 
sleep, use a bed.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.210
How many times do I hafta explain?

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.910
This is more efficient.

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:44.740
<i>Natasha?</i>

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:48.320
Who's this? What are you doing here?

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:51.650
Uh, you ask that but...

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:52.840
I was invited over for dinner...

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:54.540
I see.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:57.640
I was hoping that you 
would make a splash by

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.200
raiding the place or something.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:00.430
Yes...

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.940
I'm sorry I'm so normal...

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.610
KuruKuru.

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:05.990
KuruKuru?

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.250
That one's KuruMi.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.250
Here we have KuruIchi and KuruJi.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:12.460
There are lots more.

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.280
We refer to all of them as KuruKuru.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:16.200
Introduction finished.

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.860
<i>She looks dangerous.</i>

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:24.040
<i>Is she also one of their leaders?</i>

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:28.970
Hold up, Private Dva. 
Jimon Shiasatte (two days after tomorrow).

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.310
You added yet another day...

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:31.460
It's Asuta.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.970
Don't wander around the base

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:36.460
and find yourself in the wrong place.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:38.970
If you become stranded, you're on your own.

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:41.230
Explanation finished.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.250
Stranded?

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.990
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.990
<b>Episode 2              From the Dining Table to the Grave</b>

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.990
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.990
<b>Episode 2              From the Dining Table to the Grave</b>

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.450
If you share a meal at 
the same table, you're family 
-Hoshimiya Kate

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:10.110
<i>Wasn't he the one who sent 
the monster on its rampage?</i>

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:12.540
<i>The one who doesn't get 
dinner for a week.</i>

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:18.000
Uh, hello there.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:18.510
I'm...

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:21.640
I know. Yanoasatte-kun 
(four days from now), right?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:22.760
It's Asuta.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:32.460
My name is Morozumi Yasube. 
I'm Zvezda's chief soldier.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.150
My codename is Odin.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.550
I'll be your mentor.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.460
You've probably figured 
this out for yourself,

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:43.750
but seniority is big in our world.

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:48.000
Uh, are there any other soldiers 
besides you, Morozumi-san?

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:54.100
You're such a kid.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:56.610
Can't handle skipping a few meals?

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.890
Morozumi... san...

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.810
Call me Odin. That's what I go by.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:05.750
Yasu!

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.520
<b>No Smoking</b>

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:06.520
Yes, ma'am!

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.210
You didn't take out the trash again!

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:10.760
I'm sorry, Boss Lady!

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:15.070
Yasu, we're out of detergent!

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.620
I told you to go buy some!

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.190
I-I did!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.860
This is noodle sauce!

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:21.950
How did you mix that up, moron?!

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.640
H-Haven't you heard of using 
noodle sauce to wash clothes?!

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:25.720
It's all the rage right now!

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.050
You should have said something, then.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.900
<i>That's a robot, right?</i>

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:53.810
<i>A-Are they communicating?</i>

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:00.510
<i>Showa 22, Hiroshima.</i>

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:05.050
<i>Bloody fighting continues to rage on.</i>

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:09.570
<b>Television Drama Series</b>

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:09.570
<b>People Speaking in Hiroshima Dialect
 Without Honor and Humanity</b>

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.040
<i>Terrible news!</i>

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.190
Show's started.

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:13.080
<i>What's wrong?!</i>

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.300
<i>Boss!</i>

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:20.790
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:22.510
<i>This is looking very bad.</i>

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:26.660
<i>I didn't come here to 
join their organization.</i>

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:28.460
<i>I need to make that clear.</i>

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:32.090
<i>Yeah, that's right.</i>

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:34.940
<i>It's not like they're hiding 
any scary people in the back.</i>

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.660
Uh, so like...

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.230
<i>A scary person!</i>

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:47.370
Okay, everyone's here.

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:50.660
I love to eat alone.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.000
Since I get to hog all 
my favorite foods.

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.450
It's you...

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:03.570
However, a meal shared with others 
is seasoned with conversation.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:05.970
A seasoning that can make a 
meal taste so much better.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:10.600
So it looks like you're prepared 
to join us, Momonji Asuta.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.140
It's Jimon! Jimon Asuta!

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:17.210
This command room serves as the nucleus 
of the secret society Zvezda.

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:21.510
No one has ever come this 
far and left alive.

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.700
So, whose turn is it to make dinner?

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:27.150
Who's cooking?

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:32.020
Well, I don't get any dinner, 
so I haven't been paying attention.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.110
So sorry.

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.030
What?

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:35.640
Today is a special day.

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:37.630
You get a temporary reprieve.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:38.670
Really?!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:40.170
Time for dinner, guys.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:52.660
One, two, three people.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:53.350
Got it.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:05.280
It's your favorite 
Salisbury steak, Kate!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.720
I worked really hard on it!

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:11.150
U-Uh-huh... I-It looks delicious.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.600
Salisbury steak...

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:18.310
Don't forget to eat your veggies.

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:21.090
You won't grow up to be a big 
girl if you're a picky eater.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:22.860
Yes, I'll eat my veggies...

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:24.000
Veggies?!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.680
<i>Is this safe to eat?</i>

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:31.390
<i>Wait, I shouldn't judge the 
food by its appearance.</i>

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.280
<i>Plus, the smell's not so bad...</i>

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.010
Udo?! Only udo?!

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:47.370
Oh, that one only eats those special 
energy bars... because she's a robot.

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.110
But it's just udo.

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:51.910
Oh, I forgot to introduce you.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.600
Her name is Roboko.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.090
I'm Roboko.

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:56.660
<i>Didn't try very hard, huh?</i>

00:14:57.190 --> 00:15:03.920
Now, let us give thanks to the conquerors of veggies, fishies and cows.

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:05.400
Thank you for this meal.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:06.450
Thanks for the meal.

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:08.130
Thank you for the meal...

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:54.410
<i>Why do I feel this sense of defeat 
in the back of my throat...</i>

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:11.000
Looks like the UDO readings are 
especially higher in this area.

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:13.910
That's...

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:15.370
Asu—

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.190
I mean, young man!

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:18.700
Get up, young man!

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:23.050
This is terrible. Who did this to you?

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:26.230
What's this?

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.540
This is White Robin.

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:35.120
I've found someone who appears 
to be one of Zvezda's victims.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.300
Requesting aid immediately.

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.930
Roger that. Backup's on the way.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.430
<i>Who's that...</i>

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:44.180
What do you intend to 
do, Captain Robin?

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:47.900
This is the perfect opportunity 
to uncover the enemy base.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:51.260
I will continue searching for 
signs of Zvezda activity.

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:54.830
<i>Enemy... base?</i>

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:57.270
<i>Signs of Zvezda activity?</i>

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:01.080
<i>That doesn't sound good...</i>

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:07.650
They're nearby.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:32.150
Secret Society 
<b>Zvezda 
</b>Headquarters

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:37.870
What's that?!

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:43.530
Have mercy!

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:45.650
You again?!

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:48.620
I noticed that the KuruKurus 
were gone again!

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:50.840
What did you do this time?!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:52.550
I didn't do anything!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.720
I was hungry and out of money,

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.620
so I tried fiddling around with the

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:58.680
Udo sweet bun vending 
machine that was here!

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:04.610
Idiot!

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:09.520
That was a special energy tank meant 
to be saved for a big battle!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.480
What?! You should have said something!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.560
There's something underground...

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:22.410
<b>Shikabane Entertainment LLC</b>

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:31.040
Wait, wait, wait.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.620
What am I doing?

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:35.420
Why should I be helping them?

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:37.640
Good job.

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:39.970
We'll take it from here.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.930
Go, my minions!

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:48.340
It's the job of a parent 
to clean up after a child.

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:52.630
What if the child is 
a miserable failure?

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:57.660
Then you have to get physical.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.020
It disappeared?

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:18.840
Okay, so what was the 
cause of this incident?

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:20.800
It wasn't my fault!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.220
I had no control over what happened!

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:23.050
What?

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:25.740
I-It was because I was hungry!

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:27.750
I was about to starve to death!

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:30.510
What's that?!

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:33.820
So my cooking wasn't 
good enough for you?!

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.530
Well, you can't blame him for 
wanting to skip that dinner.

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:47.580
Yeah! I-It wasn't Yasu-san's fault!

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:53.080
Well, he was partially to blame, 
but he wasn't the main cause!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:57.550
You're defending this idiot?

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.930
The main cause was your 
horrible cooking!

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:06.000
A-After conquering the world,

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:09.110
if you try to feed your 
citizens chemical weapons,

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:10.680
y-your new nation will fall apart!

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.090
Oh?

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:14.810
You lookin' for a trip 
straight to Hell?!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.570
Cool it, all of you!

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:24.200
Me, too?!

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:29.690
<b>Venera's Variations in Persuasion
Fire</b>

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.690
Don't start silly fights.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:35.090
Always pick fights that 
are entertaining.

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:36.040
However,

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.910
never pick fights with the enemy.

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:41.550
When we battle the enemy, it's war.

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:45.140
Whenever you get in a fight, 
you always have to make up.

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:48.350
We have shared food 
from the same table,

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:50.310
which makes us family.

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:55.230
You aren't done yet?

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:58.440
Why don't you cook for us, then?

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:21.800
Delicious!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:24.260
Oh... Th-Thanks.

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:30.600
Bastard!

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:33.700
You better teach me how to cook.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:34.850
What?!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.350
O-Okay...

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:38.740
And that's a wrap.

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:40.710
W-Way to go, Great One!

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:44.190
Yasu, you're assigned to be a 
guinea pig for Itsuka's cooking.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:47.060
What's that?!

00:21:47.060 --> 00:21:49.690
You're not happy about having a 
high school girl cook for you?!

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:51.390
No, of course not!

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:52.230
I'm honored!

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:53.330
W-Wait a moment...

00:21:54.050 --> 00:21:55.000
Natasha.

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:57.170
I know, General.

00:21:57.570 --> 00:21:59.180
I've already taken care of it.

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:04.160
Impossible...

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:05.690
It was right here...

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:07.490
Looks like we're back to square one.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:11.600
<b>Dinner</b>

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:13.670
<b>Conquered</b>

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:13.680
<b>Dinner</b>

00:23:59.950 --> 00:24:02.290
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:24:00.840 --> 00:24:04.560
My name is Odin. I embrace solitude.

00:24:04.900 --> 00:24:09.260
I only feel warmth when 
I can enjoy a smoke.

00:24:09.700 --> 00:24:12.300
However, world conquest 
is truly a trying task.

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:17.670
When seeking to take all, there's no 
room for anything else in your hands.

00:24:18.230 --> 00:24:21.810
If it must be this hard, 
then I'm finished...

00:24:22.320 --> 00:24:26.980
Hey, Yasu. I can't get the 
smell of dried bonito out.

00:24:26.980 --> 00:24:29.970
<b>Episode 3    Hiding Behind Smoke and Mirrors</b>
